  <h1>Privacy</h1>

  <p>
    This is a personal portfolio and technical blog operated by Armand Sallé.
    The site provides public professional information and does not offer user
    accounts, payments, comments, or an authenticated application.
  </p>

  <h2>Information processed</h2>

  <p>
    The site itself does not intentionally set advertising cookies or use forms
