    processed by the hosting and network providers for security, reliability,
    abuse prevention, and delivery. Such logs can include an IP address, request
    time, requested URL, browser information, and technical error details.
  </p>

  <p>
    If you contact me by email, the information in your message is processed
    only to read, answer, and follow up on that conversation. Do not send
    passwords, API keys, health information, financial records, or other
    unnecessary sensitive data. You may ask for correction or deletion of
    information you supplied by writing to
    <a href="mailto:armand.salle@gmail.com">armand.salle@gmail.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>External services</h2>

  <p>
    Articles can link to third-party websites and interactive examples. Those
    services have their own privacy practices and may receive ordinary request
    information when you visit them. This notice applies only to
    armand-salle.fr.
  </p>

  <p>
    For any privacy question concerning this site, contact
    <a href="mailto:armand.salle@gmail.com">armand.salle@gmail.com</a>.
  </p>
</SitePage>
